<h2 class="kt-adv-heading18_b41839-b5 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_b41839-b5">listing<br><span class="yellow">Proces</span></h2>



<p class="kt-adv-heading18_beaf66-74 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_beaf66-74">Applicable to Public Offerings &amp; Private Placements</p>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_18c9ad-0b"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_9d3290-3c step"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<p class="kt-adv-heading18_a5341a-a3 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-1-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_a5341a-a3">Step 1</p>



<h4 class="kt-adv-heading18_7741af-c9 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_7741af-c9">Partner Selection</h4>


<p class="kt-adv-heading18_264b05-7b wp-block-kadence-advancedheading kt-adv-heading-has-icon has-theme-palette4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_264b05-7b"><span class="kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-adv-heading-icon kb-svg-icon-kb-custom-108 kb-adv-heading-icon-side-left"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"  fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"  aria-hidden="true"><g mask="url(#mask0_2005_2348)"><path d="M9.16667 17.5V10.8333H2.5V9.16667H9.16667V2.5H10.8333V9.16667H17.5V10.8333H10.8333V17.5H9.16667Z"/></g></svg></span><span class="kb-adv-text-inner">Choose a registered Listing Advisor or Broker to guide the process.</span></p></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_7b9429-ca step"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<p class="kt-adv-heading18_da54d9-42 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-1-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_da54d9-42">Step 2</p>



<h4 class="kt-adv-heading18_026d80-53 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_026d80-53">Preparation</h4>


<p class="kt-adv-heading18_39830a-d8 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading kt-adv-heading-has-icon has-theme-palette4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_39830a-d8"><span class="kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-adv-heading-icon kb-svg-icon-kb-custom-108 kb-adv-heading-icon-side-left"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"  fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"  aria-hidden="true"><g mask="url(#mask0_2005_2348)"><path d="M9.16667 17.5V10.8333H2.5V9.16667H9.16667V2.5H10.8333V9.16667H17.5V10.8333H10.8333V17.5H9.16667Z"/></g></svg></span><span class="kb-adv-text-inner">Public Offering: draft a prospectus; consult legal and accounting experts.</span></p>

<p class="kt-adv-heading18_c707ef-3f wp-block-kadence-advancedheading kt-adv-heading-has-icon has-theme-palette4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_c707ef-3f"><span class="kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-adv-heading-icon kb-svg-icon-kb-custom-108 kb-adv-heading-icon-side-left"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"  fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"  aria-hidden="true"><g mask="url(#mask0_2005_2348)"><path d="M9.16667 17.5V10.8333H2.5V9.16667H9.16667V2.5H10.8333V9.16667H17.5V10.8333H10.8333V17.5H9.16667Z"/></g></svg></span><span class="kb-adv-text-inner">Private Placement: prepare an offering circular or PPM (Private Placement Memorandum).</span></p></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_02b844-28 step"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<p class="kt-adv-heading18_7cae85-a3 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-1-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_7cae85-a3">Step 3</p>



<h4 class="kt-adv-heading18_d0a289-9b wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_d0a289-9b">Registration</h4>


<p class="kt-adv-heading18_0cce87-ae wp-block-kadence-advancedheading kt-adv-heading-has-icon has-theme-palette4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_0cce87-ae"><span class="kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-adv-heading-icon kb-svg-icon-kb-custom-108 kb-adv-heading-icon-side-left"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"  fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"  aria-hidden="true"><g mask="url(#mask0_2005_2348)"><path d="M9.16667 17.5V10.8333H2.5V9.16667H9.16667V2.5H10.8333V9.16667H17.5V10.8333H10.8333V17.5H9.16667Z"/></g></svg></span><span class="kb-adv-text-inner">Submit documentation to the DCSX for official registration.</span></p></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_e6a013-df step"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<p class="kt-adv-heading18_ad9c07-54 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-1-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_ad9c07-54">Step 4</p>



<h4 class="kt-adv-heading18_efc7ea-be wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_efc7ea-be">Listing</h4>


<p class="kt-adv-heading18_c63f5d-0c wp-block-kadence-advancedheading kt-adv-heading-has-icon has-theme-palette4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_c63f5d-0c"><span class="kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-adv-heading-icon kb-svg-icon-kb-custom-108 kb-adv-heading-icon-side-left"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"  fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"  aria-hidden="true"><g mask="url(#mask0_2005_2348)"><path d="M9.16667 17.5V10.8333H2.5V9.16667H9.16667V2.5H10.8333V9.16667H17.5V10.8333H10.8333V17.5H9.16667Z"/></g></svg></span><span class="kb-adv-text-inner">Obtain Listing Committee approval.</span></p>

<p class="kt-adv-heading18_9afb82-d3 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading kt-adv-heading-has-icon has-theme-palette4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_9afb82-d3"><span class="kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-adv-heading-icon kb-svg-icon-kb-custom-108 kb-adv-heading-icon-side-left"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"  fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"  aria-hidden="true"><g mask="url(#mask0_2005_2348)"><path d="M9.16667 17.5V10.8333H2.5V9.16667H9.16667V2.5H10.8333V9.16667H17.5V10.8333H10.8333V17.5H9.16667Z"/></g></svg></span><span class="kb-adv-text-inner">Dematerialize shares and deposit with a DCSX-approved custodian.</span></p>

<p class="kt-adv-heading18_82d861-d9 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading kt-adv-heading-has-icon has-theme-palette4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_82d861-d9"><span class="kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-adv-heading-icon kb-svg-icon-kb-custom-108 kb-adv-heading-icon-side-left"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"  fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"  aria-hidden="true"><g mask="url(#mask0_2005_2348)"><path d="M9.16667 17.5V10.8333H2.5V9.16667H9.16667V2.5H10.8333V9.16667H17.5V10.8333H10.8333V17.5H9.16667Z"/></g></svg></span><span class="kb-adv-text-inner">For tradeable listings: begin trading on the Main Market.</span></p>

<p class="kt-adv-heading18_a06cb0-25 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading kt-adv-heading-has-icon has-theme-palette4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_a06cb0-25"><span class="kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-adv-heading-icon kb-svg-icon-kb-custom-108 kb-adv-heading-icon-side-left"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"  fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"  aria-hidden="true"><g mask="url(#mask0_2005_2348)"><path d="M9.16667 17.5V10.8333H2.5V9.16667H9.16667V2.5H10.8333V9.16667H17.5V10.8333H10.8333V17.5H9.16667Z"/></g></svg></span><span class="kb-adv-text-inner">For technical listings: initiate direct listing on the Entry Market.</span></p></div></div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_a0d2e7-45"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_0579fc-5d"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<h4 class="kt-adv-heading18_6cbd64-8a wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-3-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_6cbd64-8a">You are a listed Company!</h4>



<p class="kt-adv-heading18_b047a1-46 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-3-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_b047a1-46">Once listed, trade-approved securities can become available for trading through DCSX-registered brokers. Listed companies must regularly disclose material information -including interim and audited annual reports -via their Listing Advisor.</p>
</div></div>
</div></div>

</div></div></div></div>



