<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_aeaa20-04"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<h4 class="kt-adv-heading18_b1fa6e-45 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_b1fa6e-45">Trading Fees:</h4>



<p class="kt-adv-heading18_63ad10-3d wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_63ad10-3d">DCSX commission: 0.15% per trade (applied on both buy and sell).</p>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn kb-buttons-wrap kb-btns18_1d7040-5d"><a class="kb-button kt-button button kb-btn18_9ff0fd-40 kt-btn-size-standard kt-btn-width-type-auto kb-btn-global-inherit kt-btn-has-text-true kt-btn-has-svg-false wp-block-button__link wp-block-kadence-singlebtn" href="https://dcsx.cw/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Fee-Schedule-DCSX-October-2025-1.pdf"><span class="kt-btn-inner-text">Fees Schedule</span></a></div>
</div></div>

</div></div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_d72ba0-06"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"></div></div>

</div></div></div></div>

</div></div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-tab kt-tab-inner-content kt-inner-tab-5 kt-inner-tab18_a67eea-b9"><div class="kt-tab-inner-content-inner"><div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id18_c96203-6e alignfull has-theme-palette3-background-color kt-row-has-bg wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-3-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top kb-theme-content-width">

<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_ca326a-d5"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<h2 class="kt-adv-heading18_9d8a53-e7 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_9d8a53-e7">listing <span class="yellow">Advisors</span></h2>



<p class="kt-adv-heading18_807051-0b wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_807051-0b">Listing Advisors serve as strategic partners throughout your listing journey:</p>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_b217ad-08"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_e234df-65 step"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<p class="kt-adv-heading18_2e30a2-d5 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-1-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_2e30a2-d5">Step 1</p>



<h4 class="kt-adv-heading18_5f7037-96 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_5f7037-96">Pre-Listing</h4>


<p class="kt-adv-heading18_57a411-cf wp-block-kadence-advancedheading kt-adv-heading-has-icon has-theme-palette4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_57a411-cf"><span class="kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-adv-heading-icon kb-svg-icon-kb-custom-108 kb-adv-heading-icon-side-left"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"  fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"  aria-hidden="true"><g mask="url(#mask0_2005_2348)"><path d="M9.16667 17.5V10.8333H2.5V9.16667H9.16667V2.5H10.8333V9.16667H17.5V10.8333H10.8333V17.5H9.16667Z"/></g></svg></span><span class="kb-adv-text-inner">Conduct due diligence and prepare offering documents.</span></p>

<p class="kt-adv-heading18_6d585f-a7 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading kt-adv-heading-has-icon has-theme-palette4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_6d585f-a7"><span class="kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-adv-heading-icon kb-svg-icon-kb-custom-108 kb-adv-heading-icon-side-left"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"  fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"  aria-hidden="true"><g mask="url(#mask0_2005_2348)"><path d="M9.16667 17.5V10.8333H2.5V9.16667H9.16667V2.5H10.8333V9.16667H17.5V10.8333H10.8333V17.5H9.16667Z"/></g></svg></span><span class="kb-adv-text-inner">Ensure all legal, financial, and regulatory standards are met.</span></p></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_2c6f90-9b step"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<p class="kt-adv-heading18_6a3e07-dd wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-1-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_6a3e07-dd">Step 2</p>



<h4 class="kt-adv-heading18_c0a453-78 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_c0a453-78">Post-Listing</h4>


<p class="kt-adv-heading18_d6275b-e7 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading kt-adv-heading-has-icon has-theme-palette4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_d6275b-e7"><span class="kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-adv-heading-icon kb-svg-icon-kb-custom-108 kb-adv-heading-icon-side-left"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"  fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"  aria-hidden="true"><g mask="url(#mask0_2005_2348)"><path d="M9.16667 17.5V10.8333H2.5V9.16667H9.16667V2.5H10.8333V9.16667H17.5V10.8333H10.8333V17.5H9.16667Z"/></g></svg></span><span class="kb-adv-text-inner">Maintain transparency by ensuring timely disclosures.</span></p>

<p class="kt-adv-heading18_907e3c-98 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading kt-adv-heading-has-icon has-theme-palette4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_907e3c-98"><span class="kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-adv-heading-icon kb-svg-icon-kb-custom-108 kb-adv-heading-icon-side-left"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"  fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"  aria-hidden="true"><g mask="url(#mask0_2005_2348)"><path d="M9.16667 17.5V10.8333H2.5V9.16667H9.16667V2.5H10.8333V9.16667H17.5V10.8333H10.8333V17.5H9.16667Z"/></g></svg></span><span class="kb-adv-text-inner">Act as the liaison between issuer and exchange.</span></p></div></div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_6cf5d3-f9"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_a98241-6d"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<h4 class="kt-adv-heading18_e3f3c8-f1 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-3-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_e3f3c8-f1">Listing Advisor Status</h4>



<p class="kt-adv-heading18_ca867c-7b wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-3-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_ca867c-7b">DCSX awards Listing Advisor status to accredited financial, legal, or audit firms. Discover the full list of approved advisors <strong><a href="https://dcsx.cw/listing-advisors/" data-type="link" data-id="https://dcsx.cw/listing-advisors/">here</a></strong>.</p>
</div></div>
</div></div>

</div></div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-tab kt-tab-inner-content kt-inner-tab-6 kt-inner-tab18_2e9dc5-11"><div class="kt-tab-inner-content-inner"><div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id18_8ee1c8-35 alignfull has-theme-palette3-background-color kt-row-has-bg wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-2-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top kb-theme-content-width">

<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_6d2b0b-1e"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<h2 class="kt-adv-heading18_d21142-7a wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_d21142-7a">Regulation</h2>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_662682-5d"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<p class="kt-adv-heading18_526ea1-1c wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_526ea1-1c">The Dutch Caribbean Securities Exchange operates as a fully regulated, self‑regulatory organization, licensed by Curaçao’s Minister of Finance and supervised by the Central Bank of Curaçao &amp; Sint Maarten.</p>
</div></div>

</div></div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-tab kt-tab-inner-content kt-inner-tab-7 kt-inner-tab18_3df14c-0c"><div class="kt-tab-inner-content-inner"><div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id18_95b880-95 alignfull has-theme-palette3-background-color kt-row-has-bg wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-2-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top kb-theme-content-width">

<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_2b6c6f-9a"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<h2 class="kt-adv-heading18_272a92-e1 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_272a92-e1"><span class="yellow">CW ISIN</span> Code</h2>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column18_8a9afa-b0"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<p class="kt-adv-heading18_8ba478-32 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-4-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_8ba478-32">The International Securities Identification Number (ISIN), defined under ISO 6166, is the worldwide standard for uniquely identifying financial instruments — spanning equities, debt, derivatives, and more.</p>



<p class="kt-adv-heading18_55ca69-44 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-4-color has-text-color hls-none" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading18_55ca69-44">For information on getting an ISIN for Curacao based DCSX issuers click on the following <a data-type="link" data-id="https://dcsx.cw/international-securities-identification-number-isin/" href="https://dcsx.cw/international-securities-identification-number-isin/">link</a>.</p>
</div></div>

</div></div></div></div>
</div></div></div>
</div></div>

</div></div></div><!-- .entry-content -->
